The '''Tiki Outpost''' is an [[Locations|island]] in the [[Third Sea]]. 

The Tiki Outpost is a highly important island as it is used for many things, such as unlocking [[Sanguine Art]], summoning the [[Leviathan]] and unlocking [[Submerged Island]]. 
