==Notable Features==
===Spy===
{{Main|Spy}}
Interacting with the Spy is the only way to summon the [[Leviathan]]. The player can bribe him after the completion of 15-20 [[Sea Events]]. After this, they may pay {{Fragment|1,500}} to receive a clue about the Leviathan's status.

===Leviathan===
{{Main|Leviathan}}
To spawn the Leviathan, the [[Spy]] must say "''The Leviathan is out there! Go find it before it causes more destruction.''" to be able to spawn the [[Frozen Dimension]] where the Leviathan remains by going with a group exploration of 5 players or more into the [[Sea Danger Level|Sea Danger Level 6]].

===Sanguine Art===
{{Main|Sanguine Art}}
Further tying into the island's connection to the Leviathan, the Sanguine Art [[Fighting Styles|Fighting Style]] can be learned from [[Shafi]].

===Tyrant of the Skies===
{{Main|Tyrant of the Skies}}
The Tyrant of the Skies is a Lv. 2600 [[Raid Boss]] that can be spawned by killing 300 [[enemies]] in the [[Tiki Outpost]] (75 for each eye) in order to light up the eyes of the falcon statues, then break the vases around the area.

=== Dragon Talon Sage ===
{{Main|Dragon Talon Sage}}
The [[Dragon Talon Sage]] is located at the top of the tower on the left side upon entering [[Tiki Outpost]]. He allows the player to craft [[scrolls]] and [[Enchantments|enchant]] [[guns]], [[swords]] and [[Fishing Rods|fishing rods]] using the scrolls they have.

