==Notes==
* This island is famously known as a hub for players to host [[Sea Events|sea event]] hunts, most notably the [[Leviathan]]. This is possibly due to the island itself housing several [[NPCs]] that have sea event-related requirements, and its quest givers being a stationary compass for players to track how far they are out at sea. (Given that the player is within the level threshold of the island).
* It is not recommended that those with devices having lower performance output, as the Tiki Outpost has a high amount of visual effects that can cause lag to occur in such devices.
* The Tiki Outpost's back port directly leads to further [[Sea Danger Level|Danger Levels]], similar to [[Floating Turtle]] and [[Great Tree]].	
** [[Sea Events|Sea Event hunting]] is recommended to be practised from said location because it is faster.
* The Tiki Outpost will be renamed to '''<Liberation of Tiki Outpost>''' if the player is in the spawn area of the [[Tyrant of the Skies]]. But if they go to a specific area outside that spawn, the [[Locations|island]] will be renamed back to '''<Tiki Outpost>'''.

==Trivia==
* The Tiki Outpost is the first and only island to introduce rain and cloud physics, although rain can be seen outside islands in the [[Rumbling Waters]] and [[Rough Sea]].
* The rain sound effects on the island are technically part of the background music, as muting the background music also turns off the rain sounds.
* The landmass that the castle is built on is an island inside a lake inside an island, making the Tiki Outpost currently the only true recursive island in the game.
* The [[Heaven Dimension]] and [[Hell Dimension]] can be found at the top of the Tiki Outpost. It can only appear when someone is doing the [[Cursed Dual Katana/Puzzle|Cursed Dual Katana quest]].
* Near the [[Submarine Worker]]'s location, there is a room full of bookshelves. In this room there is a ladder and behind said ladder there is a snake symbol, possibly hinting at a new race. There are also cranes with the same symbol on them. There are also snake symbols on [[Hydra Island]].
* Near the area when [[Serpent Hunter]] spawns, a [[campfire]] also spawns.
* The [[Portals|Portal]] Is located at the side where the [[Sea Danger Level]] starts. 

